// 19 M_Dialog2 :
"P4279916187" "<f=M_Object t=3>Please, my dear, do not fret! <em Lecture t=5>Your 'Vanguard' society has simply gone too far, and had to be corrected. <em LaughTwo t=5>It was all quite humorous, but steps had to be taken. <em GoAway t=3>Now, don't let it trouble your pretty little head."
// 6 M_Object :
