// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskBegin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1715223917" "Serpent Drummer hands you a book entitled 'Rikti Factions Vol.1' to help you catch up, in case you weren't familiar with the Traditionalist and Restructurist factions."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2779547424" "You saved the Peace negotiations!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P571457130" "Lady Grey was teleported away to safety. You've failed in your task to protect her."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P947889437" "<color deepskyblue>Dreams of Peace and Acts of War<br>Part: One<br><br></color>The Lady Grey spoke well of you, and I can see why. The negotiations will continue, thanks to your efforts in coordinating the defense, but the Nemesis Army was not completely unsuccessful. We must now reverse their gains, and recover our losses."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1299256826" "<color deepskyblue>Dreams of Peace and Acts of War<br>Part: One<br><br></color>The Lady Grey was teleported away to safety, thankfully. You however... you have let me down on this mission and in doing so brought Nemesis closer to his goal, whatever that might be. Our 'hole' in security has allowed the Prince of Automatons to kidnapped the attendees of the peace conference. <br><br>This is not a good way to start, {HeroName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P447911059" "<color deepskyblue>Dreams of Peace and Acts of War<br>Part: Two<br><br></color>Your admirable defense of the talks will allow them to continue, but the Nemesis Army did make gains, which we must now reverse.  They captured 6 of the negotiators before they were fought back.  Fortunately, their mole-machine was damaged and has forced them to traverse natural caverns instead of traveling to their rally point more directly.  This has delayed them greatly and exposed them to counter-attack.  A counter-attack I feel you would be well-suited to lead."
// AcceptString :
"P3487956012" "Rescue captives from the Nemesis Army"
// SendOffString :
"P2436858947" "<color deepskyblue>Dreams of Peace and Acts of War<br>Part: Two<br><br></color>Our own work mapping the tunnels beneath this zone has paid off again, providing us with a direct route for you to intercept the Nemesis Army troop column. Once you get there, your goal will be to liberate the hostages. Most will likely flee, but if any are willing to help, all the better."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P854846259" "Rescue captured negotiators"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4267715462" "<color deepskyblue>Dreams of Peace and Acts of War<br>Part: Two<br><br></color>The talks still balance on a precarious edge, but your efforts have helped to sway the Traditionalists. We are close, and the rescue of the hostages will bring us closer."

