// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - WholeLottaBrass 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P706388231" "Defeat Fake Nemeses"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P930667687" "You have defeated the leaders of the Nemesis Army's attack."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3760842075" "You have rescued all of the diplomats and negotiators and stopped the Nemesis Army's escape!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P342618572" "You weren't able to save the General Aarons and C'Kelkah."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4129247464" "<color deepskyblue>Dreams of Peace and Acts of War<br>Part: Two<br><br></color>Though some of the diplomats and negotiators will be spending some time in the hospital after their ordeal, all will recover, and the negotiations will continue. Unless some sort of devastating attack occurs, we should be able to conclude these negotiations soon."
// RandomFameString :
"P1869015624" "I heard a rumor that {HeroName} is part of some big Vanguard negotiations."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4256127675" "<color deepskyblue>Dreams of Peace and Acts of War<br>Part: Two<br><br></color>Luckily, we were able to teleport General Aarons and C'Kelkah away, but this is a bad sign. The Traditionalist are threatening to pull out of the peace talks if we don't get results on this Nemesis angle soon."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3781784571" "<color deepskyblue>Dreams of Peace and Acts of War<br>Part: Three<br><br></color>Rikti Restructurist forces are amassing for an attack against our base. They fear the signing of the peace treaty between us and their rival faction, the Traditionalists. This attack must be held off and actions all over the city have depleted our forces. {HeroName}, can we count on you to defend this base?"
// AcceptString :
"P2735752000" "Defend the base!"
// SendOffString :
"P1627932840" "<color deepskyblue>Dreams of Peace and Acts of War<br>Part: Three<br><br></color>Very soon, the peace between the peoples of Earth and one of the two Rikti factions on our world will be signed. But that will not happen if the coming attack is not stopped. Our other agents are trying to counter-attack, but our new Traditionalist allies have promised assistance. Link up with any other troops, and be prepared for any kind of Rikti attack. This will only end once the Raid leader shows himself, and is defeated. Good luck."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P233432958" "Defend Vanguard Base"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3487978342" "<color deepskyblue>Dreams of Peace and Acts of War<br>Part: Three<br><br></color>We will be doing our utmost to secure the base, but if you are unable to stop the advance outside, I do not know if we will succeed. I'm not sure help will arrive in time."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3555583132" "Rikti attacks are a constant threat, but they're really throwing everything into this one!"
// Script Variable WaveShout :
"P3635152452" "<shout>Base:  Infiltrate!"
// Script Variable PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P3718209713" "Seek: Destroy"
// Script Variable PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P1893239250" "Hunt: Kill"

