// Dialog :
"P1101626277" "You fought off the Rikti attack"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3271696134" "<color deepskyblue>Dreams of Peace and Acts of War<br>Part: Four<br><br></color>The Rikti moved within moments after the Traditionalists began their plan. I fear that they anticipated our maneuver. The next logical step would be for them to counter-attack. This has me worried."
// RandomFameString :
"P691826078" "My cousin over on Peregrine Island says the Rikti would have razed the whole island if it wasn't for {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2164587016" "<color deepskyblue>Dreams of Peace and Acts of War<br>Part: Five<br><br></color>Reports are coming in of Rikti attacks both in Paragon City and in the Rogue Isles. I am coordinating actions with Levantera and Borea to fight them, but we need all available help."
// AcceptString :
"P1664443618" "Fight back Rikti attacks"
// SendOffString :
"P2227314082" "<color deepskyblue>Dreams of Peace and Acts of War<br>Part: Five<br><br></color>Good. We are responding to incidents as they arise, but there are attacks everywhere. Speak to Borea, she will set your first target for counter-attack."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission5_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2492930717" "Get target from Borea"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3286609453" "Talk to Borea first. We must coordinate our counter-strikes carefully or we will be overwhelmed."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1474568796" "{HeroName}. I'm glad to see you're still with us. Something has the Rikti in a frenzy. We've even received requests for help from the Rogue Isles. It seems Dr. Aeon isn't entirely willing to rely on Arachnos to protect the Power Transfer System in Cap Au Diable. We're sending you in by teleporter to the PTS control center to help the good doctor protect this power system. Once you're done there, Levantera will have your next assignment."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission5_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P76669933" "Defend PTS"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P212251642" "<color deepskyblue>Dreams of Peace and Acts of War<br>Part: Five<br><br></color>Cap Au Diable, is it? I have tangled with Dr. Aeon once or twice. He is completely nuts, but he will usually do whatever it takes to keep himself in one piece."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P460859048" "The heat in here is absolutely infernal!"
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_NAME :
"P1509541266" "Dr. Aeon"
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P4290140148" "I'll... I'll tell you everything you want to know, if you spare me!"
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2360054984" "Help me! I'm too intelligent to die!"
// Script Variable CAPTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P884912198" "Trick Use: Negative"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2448650975" "Rikti Magus"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3167170093" "Status Query: Entity Bat'Zul?"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3660325961" "Interference: Unacceptable!"
// Script Variable SayOnRescue :
"P516812596" "Uh, I was just about to, uh, trick them, yes. <em>Well, never mind. We've got to shut down the PTS before it esca...<em>um... aah... <em>Explodes! Yes, before it explodes. <em>Just help me get to the main control computer!"
// Script Variable SayOnArrival :
"P1700158203" "Right, that's taken care of and I'm out of here!"
// Script Variable SayOnRecapture :
"P1352571939" "Hello, interdimensional space-friends! I come in peace! Please, don't shoot me!"
// Script Variable SayOnRerescue :
"P1360111882" "Yeah, you alien scum are lucky {HeroName} is here to hold me back!"
// Script Variable SayOnStranded :
"P840658397" "How can I be lost in my own facility? Argh!"
// Script Variable RescueObjectiveText :
"P200004774" "Rescue Dr. Aeon"
