// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P358832783" "Speak to Levantera"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P626063290" "<color deepskyblue>Dreams of Peace and Acts of War<br>Part: Five<br><br></color>Your success in the PTS has relieved a number of worries, but the attacks continue. Speak with Levantera; she'll have your next objective."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P944083241" "Wish I had better news for you, but the Rikti are still on the attack. Your next objective will be Overbrook Dam in Paragon City. Longbow forces are already on the scene, but are getting overwhelmed by the Rikti. You need to take out the raid's leader. Good luck!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission5_Part4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3089935956" "Clear Rikti from Dam"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1299161075" "<color deepskyblue>Dreams of Peace and Acts of War<br>Part: Five<br><br></color>The Rikti attacks are still going strong. We cannot let our guard down now."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2947937231" "Overbrook Dam has seen a lot of trouble over all these years."
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_NAME :
"P2335706646" "Lt. Sefu Tendaji"
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3435762882" "You will not hold me here long."
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3443703605" "Reinforcements have arrived."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
