// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P379386349" "Raider Ga'Emnon"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3876727906" "<shout>Hro'Dtohz Strategy: Outmaneuvered Humanity!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - RiktiDefeated 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P2116822412" "Defeat Raider Ga'Emmon"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3503156343" "You've defeated the raid's leader. He had some important looking documentation on him."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3240239362" "You have stopped the Rikti Raids"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3898084408" "<color deepskyblue>Dreams of Peace and Acts of War<br>Part: Five<br><br></color>These raids were coordinated well. Your actions and the actions of many others prevented a great deal of damage, but I fear that our latest intelligence shows that this was only a diversion for their next true objective. I only hope the information you found can tell us what that objective might be. I will run this by Mr. Decker, we should know the contents soon."
// RandomFameString :
"P3183598320" "They shut down my building due to a Rikti attack. It's just like the war all over again."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P51133828" "<color deepskyblue>Dreams of Peace and Acts of War<br>Part: Finale<br><br></color>The information you retrieve has been translated by Mr. Decker. It details the timetable for this phase of the Rikti's plan, and gives us an opportunity. Hro'Dtohz himself is going to be inspecting part of the tunnel network. He will be exposed, and could be captured with a quick, surgical strike. You have done so much already, I thought it only proper that you undertake this task."
// AcceptString :
"P335598567" "Strike Wargod Hro'Dtohz"
// SendOffString :
"P1899708230" "<color deepskyblue>Dreams of Peace and Acts of War<br>Part: Finale<br><br></color>If we can defeat the leader of the Lineage of War now, it would cripple the Rikti's military efforts. We sent ahead a scout team to try and confirm the intelligence, but haven't heard back from them. If you can locate them, they could be of great help to you."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2777936548" "Defeat Hro'Dtohz"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P417523582" "<color deepskyblue>Dreams of Peace and Acts of War<br>Part: Finale<br><br></color>Hro'Dtohz is your main target. But I fear that even if he's unprepared, he won't be easy to defeat."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1273135657" "If you can catch Hro'Dtohz by surprise, it could change the shape of the entire conflict."
